{
  "name": "01 - Intake / Email Import (Gmail)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "node-0009",
      "name": "Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        -200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Email Import (Gmail) — SCAFFOLD, inactive\n\nSingle Responsibility: watch for bank e-statement emails and forward the raw text to the app's existing SMS/text import engine (POST /api/imports/sms) — this workflow deliberately does NOT parse bank text itself. Parsing, validation, dedup, and categorization already live server-side in importService.processSms(); duplicating that here would create a second, divergent source of truth.\n\nTo activate:\n1. Add Gmail OAuth2 credentials to the Gmail Trigger node and set a filter (label/sender) for your bank's statement emails.\n2. Set BUDGETFLOW_IMPORT_TOKEN as an n8n env var — this is the PER-USER import token from Settings > Import (bf_import_... — NOT the same as BUDGETFLOW_SERVICE_API_KEY used elsewhere).\n3. Set this workflow Active.",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "gmail-trigger",
      "name": "Gmail Trigger (configure me)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmailTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        320
      ],
      "disabled": true,
      "parameters": {
        "filters": {},
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-0010",
      "name": "Extract Message Text",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        520,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "// Normalize the incoming Gmail message into { sender, message, receivedAt }.\nconst msg = $json;\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    sender: (msg.from || \"\").split(\"<\")[0].trim() || \"Email\",\n    message: msg.text || msg.snippet || \"\",\n    receivedAt: msg.date || new Date().toISOString(),\n  },\n}];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-0011",
      "name": "Forward to Import Engine",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        800,
        320
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 2000,
      "continueOnFail": true,
      "alwaysOutputData": true,
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.BUDGETFLOW_BASE_URL + '/api/imports/sms' }}",
        "authentication": "none",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "={{ 'Bearer ' + $env.BUDGETFLOW_IMPORT_TOKEN }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendQuery": false,
        "options": {
          "timeout": 15000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": true,
              "responseFormat": "json",
              "fullResponse": true
            }
          }
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ ({ \"sender\": ($json.sender), \"message\": ($json.message), \"receivedAt\": ($json.receivedAt) }) }}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-0012",
      "name": "Needs Review?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1080,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "node-0013",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.outcome === 'review_required' }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-0014",
      "name": "Rejected Or Failed?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1080,
        520
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "node-0015",
              "leftValue": "={{ ['rejected', 'failed'].includes($json.body.outcome) }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-0016",
      "name": "Notify: Low Confidence Import",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflow",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1360,
        220
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "source": "database",
        "workflowId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "SELECT_AFTER_IMPORT:04 - Notifications / Low Confidence Import",
          "cachedResultName": "04 - Notifications / Low Confidence Import"
        },
        "workflowInputs": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData",
          "value": {}
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "After importing, point this at the \"04 - Notifications / Low Confidence Import\" workflow (n8n assigns IDs on import)."
    },
    {
      "id": "node-0017",
      "name": "Notify: Import Failed",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflow",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1360,
        520
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "source": "database",
        "workflowId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "SELECT_AFTER_IMPORT:04 - Notifications / Import Failed",
          "cachedResultName": "04 - Notifications / Import Failed"
        },
        "workflowInputs": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData",
          "value": {}
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "After importing, point this at the \"04 - Notifications / Import Failed\" workflow (n8n assigns IDs on import)."
    },
    {
      "id": "node-0018",
      "name": "Log Success",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflow",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1360,
        700
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "source": "database",
        "workflowId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "SELECT_AFTER_IMPORT:05 - Utilities / Logger",
          "cachedResultName": "05 - Utilities / Logger"
        },
        "workflowInputs": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData",
          "value": {}
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "After importing, point this at the \"05 - Utilities / Logger\" workflow (n8n assigns IDs on import)."
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
